              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jillian"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Excellent salad dressing, it's a bit on the sweet side which was nice. I cut it down to 8 servings and it was a bit on the oily side so I added more apple cider vinegar (just a little) to compensate for that. It went great over mixed greens. It's a keeper!"
          },
