            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kim Nolan Molina"
            },
            "reviewBody": "ElVery easy and so much cheaper than butlying bottled oil and vinegar dressing! Best of all this dressing reminds me of my Mom's but made healthier by Olive oil.l,( mom made hers with vegetable oil). I went by the recipe,except I substituted Steva sweetener for the sugar as I'm watching my sugar intake. It tasted so good as a dressing for cucumbers. I'll be keeping this as a dressing staple in my fridge.",
            "datePublished": "2018-07-26T21:15:20.280Z"
          },
          {
